{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1500 \u00een trun\u021ba din flandra. Cuptorul de p\u00e2ine Cald, iar buc\u0103teria miroasea secar\u0103 \u0219i afum. \u0218tiai ca aici \u00eenp\u0103na la 4 zile din zice, e interzit s\u0103 man\u0103\u0219carne? Vinerea. Postul mare, adventul, biserica le spune zile de post\u0103. Uite ce ai \u00een farfurie. P\u00e2inea proape la fiecare mas\u0103. Terci maz\u0103re \u0219i fasole, bere de b\u0103ut. Pe\u0219te uscat \u00een zilele de post. Cea mai mare parte din ce, chel tu e familia ta, seduce pe m\u00e2ncare. Seapte ze\u0219ti p\u00e2n\u0103 la 80 la suta. C\u00e2nd recolta nu e se, p\u00e2inea se scompe\u0219te brusc, iar oamenii fl\u0103m\u00e2nt ze\u0219ti. C\u00e2t treie\u0219ti? \u00cen anglia chiar pe este mare un nou n\u0103scut putea spera la vr\u0103 30 \u0219i 5 de ani. Mai ales pentru c\u0103 mureau foarte mul\u021bi copii. Dac\u0103 apucai 30 de ani, avea i\u0219an se destul de bune, s\u0103 ajungi la 60. Deci ce e m\u00e2ncarea pentru tine? Combustibil. C\u00e2t s\u0103 supravia\u021bi o ie\u0219ti ziua. Sine minte zilele de post. Revin la final. Iar pe mare \u00een cele mai lungi calatorii, marinarii \u00eencep s\u0103 se destrame.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.7, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1500 \u00een trun\u021ba din flandra.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 15351, 364, 425, 2119, 628, 15351, 504, 409, 15918, 64, 3791, 932, 474, 424, 13, 50569], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.42960088393267465, "compression_ratio": 1.407114624505929, "no_speech_prob": 0.050586748868227005, "words": [{"word": " Te", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2, "probability": 0.40412119030952454}, {"word": " treze\u0219ti", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.68, "probability": 0.7899040132761002}, {"word": " \u00een", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.88, "probability": 0.5065162777900696}, {"word": " anul", "start": 0.88, "end": 1.16, "probability": 0.9138665199279785}, {"word": " 1500", "sta